cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the released feature table, please cite the paper and this repository."
type: software
title: "Turbulence Fingerprint: code and derived data"
abstract: >-
  Code and derived data for the manuscript "Higher-Order Intermittency in Learned
  Neural Motion Representations: A Testable Statistical Prediction". Contains the
  four-dimensional optical-flow feature table for the 1,635-clip cross-generator
  evaluation set, the five-fold assignment used in every experiment, per-clip
  scores for the foundation-model baseline and the D3 detector, and the scripts
  that regenerate the reported AUROCs.
